# Network-specific behavior: independent guides for each non-EVM family, plus EVM collection.
networks=[
('bitcoin-cash','Bitcoin Cash','BCH','Uses Bitcoin Cash addresses and its own history. Do not send Bitcoin (BTC) to this network.','Bitcoin Cash balances and history use the wallet’s supported HD branches or imported key scope.'),
('dogecoin','Dogecoin','DOGE','Uses Dogecoin addresses. A Dogecoin key is not interchangeable with a similarly shaped Bitcoin address.','The app scans supported HD receiving and change branches, or the imported single-key account.'),
('litecoin','Litecoin','LTC','Use the address-type control when available for the imported wallet material.','The balance scan includes supported address branches even when a different type is selected for receiving.'),
('solana','Solana','SOL','Balances, discovered tokens and activity follow the active Solana address.','If a recovered account looks empty, check the Phantom or Trust Wallet path in Receive. Token mint addresses identify SPL assets.'),
('tron','TRON','TRX','Choose TRON at the sender for TRX and compatible TRON tokens.','Use a TRON contract address for manual token lookup. An Ethereum USDT contract is a different token deployment.'),
('gram','Gram','GRAM','The app labels this network Gram and recognizes TON-related search aliases.','Check the network and full receive address rather than relying only on the displayed coin name. Jetton holdings and their prices depend on data coverage.'),
('aptos','Aptos','APT','Uses an Aptos account and network-specific token identities.','Aptos asset types and fungible-asset references are not EVM contracts even when hexadecimal values look similar.'),
('sui','Sui Network','SUI','Uses a Sui account and Sui coin types.','Token identity depends on its Sui type, not just a ticker. A 0x prefix alone does not identify an Ethereum account.'),
('near','NEAR Protocol','NEAR','Shows data for the wallet’s active NEAR account.','An imported key may not correspond to the named NEAR account you expect. Compare the full account shown in Receive with the account that holds the funds.'),
('xrp-ledger','XRP Ledger','XRP','Shows XRP and supported issued assets for the active ledger account.','An issued asset is identified by currency and issuer, not its name alone. Exchange destinations may require a destination tag; this build does not have a send form.'),
('stellar','Stellar','XLM','Shows XLM and supported assets for the active Stellar account.','Issued assets depend on both asset code and issuer. Exchange destinations may require a memo; this build does not have a send form.')]
